    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_421a6ad8",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: portable-dishwasher-slash-sandwich-maker; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image shows a happy couple in a new home, with the text overlay 'portable dishwasher slash sandwich maker'. The overall intent is to humorously mock or satirize the idea of a single appliance that does two very different things — one practical (dishwashing) and one absurd (making sandwiches). The juxtaposition of the joyful, aspirational image of homeownership with the ridiculous, impractical appliance suggestion creates a comedic effect. While not explicitly hateful or abusive, the meme is potentially harmful because it trivializes the concept of a functional appliance by pairing it with an absurd, nonsensical function, which could be seen as mocking the practicality or seriousness of household appliances. The humor is derived from the absurdity of the claim, not from targeting any specific group or individual, but the implication that such a device is so ridiculous it's not worth considering, which could be interpreted as a dismissive or mocking tone toward practical household solutions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_43d6f0a3"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
