      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_022db6d3",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with common humor tropes, such as satirical juxtaposition and product mockery through absurdity. The visual of a happy couple in a new home is a universally recognizable aspirational image, and the text 'portable dishwasher slash sandwich maker' relies on shared knowledge of appliance functionality and the expectation of practicality in household goods. The humor is accessible to anyone who understands the absurdity of combining two unrelated functions in a single appliance, without requiring specific cultural, demographic, or identity-based knowledge.",
